OL,3,GNEWSAWhat's a golden spurtle and why do
OL,4,Aso many people want one?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhat does a bakery owner from San
OL,7,FFrancisco have in common with a retired
OL,8,FBritish Army officer, a newly-qualified
OL,9,FScottish lawyer, a US Marine veteran,
OL,10,Fan Edinburgh artist and a teacher from
OL,11,FFife?
OL,13,FAll of them - plus a 2026 MasterChef UK
OL,14,Ffinalist - are preparing to fight for
OL,15,Fthe title of World Porridge Making
OL,16,FChampion.
OL,18,FThe annual oat-off has never been more
OL,19,Fpopular, with double the number of
OL,20,Fentrants than the previous highest
OL,21,Fturnout.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
