OL,3,GNEWSAWhat's a golden spurtle and why do
OL,4,Aso many people want one?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe hopefuls all want to leave the
OL,7,FHighland village of Carrbridge carrying
OL,8,Fthe Golden Spurtle, porridge making's
OL,9,Fmost coveted award.
